# WOBBLE DERBY: the book keeps the original's spread (five wobblers in each
# clumsiness band and each speed band, and a wild card), every drawing is
# the right size, the odds come from the record, the sponsor fee from the
# wins, and the meeting can be 3, 6, 9 or 12 races.
game wobble
wait 5
expect bands_ok == 1
expect art_ok == 1
cheat new 6 1
cheat field 0 1 2
cheat record 0 0 20
cheat record 1 0 20
cheat record 2 20 20
cheat reodds
expect odds0 == 20
expect odds1 == 20
expect odds2 == 1
cheat record 0 1 3
cheat record 1 1 3
cheat record 2 1 3
cheat reodds
expect odds0 == 2
expect odds1 == 2
expect odds2 == 2
cheat record 5 4 9
expect fee5 == 300
expect spdlo6 == 55
expect spdhi6 == 65
expect spdlo25 == 35
expect spdhi25 == 65
# the setup screen's lengths
reload
game wobble
wait 30
press DOWN
press A
wait 5
press DOWN
press DOWN
press DOWN
press RIGHT
press DOWN
press A
expect nraces == 9
